This repository contains scripts and documentation for deploying DS41RT
(https://github.com/tpurtell/ds41rt, MIT licence, copyright its authors) with the
coordinator on an RTX 5090. It vendors no DS41RT source. Where the scripts mirror
the invocation shapes of DS41RT's own run.sh and build.sh, that is deliberate so
the launches stay comparable with upstream's; the credit for those shapes is
upstream's.

patches/0003 reimplements the copy-window drafting rule of TensorFold
(https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold, MIT licence, copyright its authors) from its
description: an 8-token match against the request's own history, then the tokens that
followed as drafts. No TensorFold source is included.

DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash is DeepSeek's checkpoint, under its own licence. No weights or
images are distributed here.

The measured comparison in the accompanying report references the TP4 DGX-Spark vLLM
deployment published by tonyd2wild (https://github.com/tonyd2wild/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-vLLM-DGX-Spark)
and the standard benchmark of Local Inference Labs.
